1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,120
The first law says energy is never lost.

2
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:08,400
It only moves, and every move
leaves a little less of it useful.

3
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:12,900
That leftover is what we call entropy,
and it is the reason engines have limits.

4
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:17,000
Carnot worked this out before anyone
knew what heat actually was.
